#!/bin/sh
# Rebuild the live trust store after this package changes the Mozilla set.
#
# Without this, installing or upgrading ca-certificates left
# /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt describing the PREVIOUS trust set.
# That is not cosmetic: the 20261020 eMudhra distrust (emSign ECC Root
# CA - G3 anchored a live rogue DV chain) took effect on egg only after
# a manual update-ca-certificates run — every host that merely upgraded
# the package kept trusting the compromised chain. Observed live.
#
# apk runs this AFTER the payload is in its final state, so the new
# mozilla/*.crt set and /etc/ca-certificates.conf are on disk when the
# store is rebuilt. A failure propagates (generated callers run under
# set -eu): apk reports the error while the package still commits, loud
# instead of silently stale.
#
# Absolute paths only: hooks run under apk with a minimal PATH.
/usr/sbin/update-ca-certificates
